# Voice stealing: 12 overlapping held notes on 10 voices, long release.
oversample 4
set A.flt_cutoff 0.6
set A.aenv_attack 0
set A.aenv_release 0.6
at 0.0 on 48 100
at 0.3 on 50 100
at 0.6 on 52 100
at 0.9 on 54 100
at 1.2 on 56 100
at 1.5 on 58 100
at 1.8 on 60 100
at 2.1 on 62 100
at 2.4 on 64 100
at 2.7 on 66 100
at 3.0 on 68 100
at 3.3 on 70 100
at 5.0 off 48
at 5.0 off 50
at 5.0 off 52
at 5.0 off 54
at 5.0 off 56
at 5.0 off 58
at 5.0 off 60
at 5.0 off 62
at 5.0 off 64
at 5.0 off 66
at 5.0 off 68
at 5.0 off 70
length 8
